---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---
<DocsLayout title="部署 | 罐头喵 Canmao" description="罐头喵生产部署" current="/Canmao-site/docs/ops/deployment">
  <h1>🚢 部署</h1>
  <p>开发环境直接 <code>./Canmao</code> 运行。生产建议用 systemd 常驻守护。</p>

  <h2>systemd 服务</h2>
  <pre><code>cat &gt; /etc/systemd/system/canmao.service &lt;&lt;'EOF'
[Unit]
Description=罐头喵 Canmao - QQ Bot
After=network-online.target napcat.service
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=root
WorkingDirectory=/path/to/Canmao
Environment=GOPROXY=https://goproxy.cn,direct
Environment=PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin
ExecStart=/path/to/Canmao/Canmao
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=5
TimeoutStopSec=30

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
EOF</code></pre>

  <pre><code>systemctl daemon-reload
systemctl enable --now canmao</code></pre>

  <h2>查看日志</h2>
  <pre><code>journalctl -u canmao -f</code></pre>

  <h2>opencode 路径注意</h2>
  <blockquote>若启用 <code>acp</code>，systemd 精简环境通常没有 nvm 的 PATH。请给 <code>acp.binary</code> 填 opencode 的<strong>绝对路径</strong>，并在 <code>Environment=PATH=</code> 中注入 node bin 目录。</blockquote>

  <h2>升级</h2>
  <pre><code>cd /path/to/Canmao
git pull
go build -o Canmao .
systemctl restart canmao</code></pre>
</DocsLayout>